msgid "Neutrals by relation"
msgstr "Neutrals by relation"

msgid "Neutrals go from red to yellow to green with their faction's relation to you. Off - the neutral colour below."
msgstr "Neutrals go from red to yellow to green with their faction's relation to you. Off - the neutral colour below."

