msgstr "Neutrals"

msgid "Show through walls"
msgstr "Show through walls"

msgid "Tint characters while the highlight key is held."
msgstr "Tint characters while the highlight key is held."

msgid "Tinted characters are visible through walls and buildings."
msgstr "Tinted characters are visible through walls and buildings."

msgid "While the highlight key is held, characters are tinted by how they stand to you."
msgstr "While the highlight key is held, characters are tinted by how they stand to you."

